{"id":"wb-7-1128","name":"驿前石屋里民宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"驿前石屋里民宅","text":"驿前石屋里民宅位于中国江西省抚州市广昌县驿前镇，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n驿前石屋里民宅建于清康熙五十五年（1716年），坐北朝南，平面呈长方形，面阔21米，进深38.6米，占地面积810平方米，共有两幢风格相同的建筑相连，分上、中、下三厅，有房间27间，天井7处。三厅地面均用水磨方形砖镶嵌，有过道相通。建筑的墙、柱、穿坊、地面、天井、神龛均采用石块磨光砌成，是全石材建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A9%BF%E5%89%8D%E7%9F%B3%E5%B1%8B%E9%87%8C%E6%B0%91%E5%AE%85","revisionId":93045736,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93045736","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bc579f523128dc018905f1a9.jpg","title":"Guangchang_Yiqian_2018.10.05_12-17-00.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangchang_Yiqian_2018.10.05_12-17-00.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/Guangchang_Yiqian_2018.10.05_12-17-00.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"驿前镇\n\n石屋里","width":320,"height":240}}